SR-Cad
SR-Cad is a modified version of CADCraft (https://github.com/storytold/cadcraft), renamed and
redistributed under the same MIT OR Apache-2.0 terms. It is based on CADCraft by the ArtCraft team,
but it is not made, sponsored or endorsed by the ArtCraft Team, and it does not include the ArtCraft
name, wordmark or logos (CADCraft's docs/brand/ directory has been removed).

The original CADCraft notice follows, unchanged.

